\p \v 19 \w Greet|strong="G782"\w* \w Prisca|strong="G4251"\w*\f + \fr 4:19 \fqa Prisca \ft is a variant of \fqa Priscilla\ft ; see \ref Acts 18:2|ACT 18:2\ref*.\f* \w and|strong="G2532"\w* \w Aquila|strong="G207"\w*, \w as well as|strong="G2532"\w* \w the|strong="G3588"\w* \w household|strong="G3624"\w* \w of Onesiphorus|strong="G3683"\w*.
